      ms: 9280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:yz1n1b'
    'male|a||Trace the gap at every width and you get this curve: flat for narrow windows, then sliding down as the window reaches the bend.':
